                <numberValue>1.0</numberValue>
            </value>
        </assignmentItems>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Loop_Lines</targetReference>
        </connector>
    </assignments>
    <description>FB-V1 benchmark FL07. An order always shows the current total and count of its line items: when an order line is created or updated, fetch ALL of the parent order's lines, iterate them accumulating a total (sum of Line Total) and a count, and write both to the parent order. The triggering record and the asserted record live on different objects by design.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>PLS FB FL07 Order Rollup {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>PLS FB FL07 Order Rollup</label>
    <loops>
